+      crop 284:453  Domain III only, 170 residues. H433 is in domain III and every prior
+                    BoltzGen d3 arm already targeted it alone, so this is not a new
+                    choice -- but it IS a deviation from "chain A, contiguous 1..609" in
+                    the spec, made because 609 target tokens plus a binder is ~700 tokens
